## User

Divide two integers, returning Nothing when the divisor is zero.

## Type

type
```haskell
safeDiv :: Int -> Int -> Maybe Int
```

## Term

```haskell
safeDiv x y = if x == 0 then Nothing else Just (x `div` y)
```

